[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m First, let's calculate the total cost of the party in 2007. The cost per person in 2007 is \(d\) dollars and the number of people attending is \(p\). Therefore, the total cost in 2007 is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \text{Total cost in 2007} = d \times p = dp
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \]
