[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Next, let's calculate the total cost of the party in 2008. The cost per person in 2008 is double the cost per person in 2007, so it is \(2d\) dollars. The number of people attending in 2008 is double the number of people in 2007, so it is \(2p\). Therefore, the total cost in 2008 is:
