[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 2. **Area Relationships:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    - The area of \(ABEF\) is twice the area of \(FECD\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 3. **Use the Midpoint Theorem:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    - The line segment joining the midpoints of two sides of a triangle is parallel to the third side and half as long.
