[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \text{Area}_{ABCD} = \frac{1}{2} \times (AB + DC) \times h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 5. **Divide the Trapezoid:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    - The line segment \(EF\) divides the trapezoid into two smaller trapezoids: \(ABEF\) and \(FECD\).
