[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    - The area of \(ABEF\) is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \text{Area}_{ABEF} = \frac{1}{2} \times (AB + EF) \times \frac{h}{2}
