[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - Jen and Jack throw their respective balls with the same force (\( F \)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m We need to find the ratio of the acceleration of Jen's softball (\( a_s \)) to Jack's baseball (\( a_b \)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m First, we express the force for each ball using the formula \( F = ma \):
