[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 1. **Determine the total number of possible outcomes when rolling two dice.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, so the total number of outcomes when rolling two dice is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    6 \times 6 = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 2. **Identify the favorable outcomes where the difference between the two numbers is 0.**
