[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    There are 6 such outcomes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 3. **Calculate the probability.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    The probability is the number of favorable outcomes divided by the total number of possible outcomes. So, the probability is:
