[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 1. **Determine the expected value of a single die:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    Each die has faces numbered from 1 to 8. The expected value \(E(X)\) of a single die roll is the average of all possible outcomes. This can be calculated as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    \[
