[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ F = m_s \cdot a_s \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ F = 200 \cdot a_s \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m For Jack's baseball:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ F = m_b \cdot a_b \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ F = 150 \cdot a_b \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
