[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m The population of Rod doubles every hour, starting from 2 bacteria. Therefore, the population of Rod at time \( t \) is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ P_{\text{Rod}} = 2 \times 2^t = 2^{t+1} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m The population of Sphere quadruples every hour, starting from 8 bacteria. Therefore, the population of Sphere at time \( t - 5 \) is given by:
