[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Thus, the expected value of the sum of the rolls of both dice is \(\boxed{9}\).
