[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Let's denote the length of the third side as \( x \). The triangle inequality theorem gives us the following conditions:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
