[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    - Since both dice are identical and fair, \(E(X) = E(Y) = 4.5\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    - Therefore:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      E(X + Y) = 4.5 + 4.5 = 9
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
