[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 2. \( 8 + x > 8 \) which simplifies to \( x > 0 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 3. \( 8 + x > 8 \) which simplifies to \( x > 0 \) (this is the same as the second condition).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
