[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m [response] To solve this problem, we need to find the least common multiple (LCM) of the times it takes for each gear to complete a full rotation. This will give us the time in minutes when both gears will have their marks pointing due north simultaneously. Then, we will convert this time into seconds.
