[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - The total revenue is the sum of the revenue from Monday and the revenue from the department store:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ \$340 + \$775 = \$1115 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m **Step 3: Calculate the profit.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
