[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \frac{1}{33\frac{1}{3}} = \frac{1}{\frac{100}{3}} = \frac{3}{100} \text{ minutes}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m For the second gear, which turns 45 times in a minute, the time for one full rotation is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
