[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Notice that \(a^2 - 2ab + b^2 = (a - b)^2\), so we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[2(a - b)^2 + (2b^2 + c^2 - 2ac) = 0.\]
