[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m For the equation \( 4x^2 + 8x + 3 = 0 \), we have \( a = 4 \), \( b = 8 \), and \( c = 3 \). Plugging these values into the quadratic formula, we get:
