[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m x = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{8^2 - 4 \cdot 4 \cdot 3}}{2 \cdot 4} = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{64 - 48}}{8} = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{16}}{8} = \frac{-8 \pm 4}{8}
