[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m First, let's convert the rotations per minute of each gear into a more manageable form:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - The first gear turns $33\frac{1}{3}$ times per minute, which is equivalent to $\frac{100}{3}$ rotations per minute.
