[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m The time it takes for each gear to complete one full rotation is the reciprocal of its rotations per minute:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - For the first gear, the time for one rotation is $\frac{3}{100}$ minutes.
