[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m First, let's understand how the number of divisors of a number is determined. If a number \( n \) has the prime factorization \( n = p_1^{e_1} p_2^{e_2} \cdots p_k^{e_k} \), then the number of divisors of \( n \) is given by \( (e_1 + 1)(e_2 + 1) \cdots (e_k + 1) \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
