[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m First, we note that triangles $AXY$ and $ABC$ share angle $A$. Therefore, the triangles are similar by the Angle-Angle (AA) similarity criterion.
