[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[F_{\text{softball}} = F_{\text{baseball}}\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Let \(a_{\text{softball}}\) be the acceleration of the softball and \(a_{\text{baseball}}\) be the acceleration of the baseball. The masses are given as \(200\) g for the softball and \(150\) g for the baseball. We can express the forces as:
