[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[F_{\text{softball}} = 200 \times a_{\text{softball}}\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[F_{\text{baseball}} = 150 \times a_{\text{baseball}}\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
