[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m The expected value \(E\) of a single die roll is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m E = \frac{1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + 7 + 8}{8}
