[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 4. **Calculate the cosine of the vertex angle:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m    - The cosine of \( 120^\circ \) is \( \cos 120^\circ = -\frac{1}{2} \).
