[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m The roots of a quadratic equation $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$ are given by the quadratic formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\]
