[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \Rightarrow y &= \frac{4x}{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Now, substitute $y = \frac{4x}{3}$ into the expression $\frac{2x+y}{3x-2y}$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \frac{2x+y}{3x-2y} &= \frac{2x + \frac{4x}{3}}{3x - 2\left(\frac{4x}{3}\right)} \\
