[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Given that the population of Rod doubles every hour, the population of Rod at time \(t\) can be expressed as \(2 \times 2^t = 2^{t+1}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m For Sphere, since the population quadruples every hour, the population of Sphere at time \(t-5\) can be expressed as \(8 \times 4^{t-5}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
