[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - Mass of the softball (\(m_s\)) = 200 g
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - Mass of the baseball (\(m_b\)) = 150 g
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - Force applied by Jen (\(F_s\)) = Force applied by Jack (\(F_b\))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
