[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m First, we note that the sum $\frac{1}{a}+\frac{1}{b}+\frac{1}{c}+\frac{1}{d}$ can be rewritten using the common denominator $abcd$ as follows:
