[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - Mass of softball ($m_{softball}$) = $200$ g
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - Mass of baseball ($m_{baseball}$) = $150$ g
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m - Force applied by Jen ($F_{Jen}$) = Force applied by Jack ($F_{Jack}$)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
