[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m The least common multiple (LCM) of two numbers $a$ and $b$ can be found using the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ \text{LCM}(a, b) = \frac{a \times b}{\text{GCD}(a, b)} \]
