[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[3^2 + 7^2 + 9^2 = 8^2 + 11^2 + x^2\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[9 + 49 + 81 = 64 + 121 + x^2\]
