[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \frac{-7 + i\sqrt{15}}{8} + \frac{-7 - i\sqrt{15}}{8} = \frac{-14}{8} = -\frac{7}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m This matches with $-\frac{b}{a} = -\frac{7}{4}$, which is consistent with the given equation.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
