[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Solving for \(t\), we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[t = 8\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Since she started growing Sphere 5 hours after starting Rod, she started growing Sphere \(8-5 = 3\) hours ago.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
