[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \tan(B + C) = \frac{\tan B + \tan C}{1 - \tan B \tan C} = \frac{\frac{3}{2} + \frac{1}{2}}{1 - \frac{3}{2} \cdot \frac{1}{2}} = \frac{2}{1 - \frac{3}{4}} = \frac{2}{\frac{1}{4}} = 8.
