[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m This matches $-\frac{b}{a} = -\frac{7}{4}$, which is consistent with the given equation.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
