[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m [response] First, we calculate the volume of the cylindrical beaker. The formula for the volume of a cylinder is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ V_{\text{cylinder}} = \pi r^2 h \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m where \( r = 3 \) cm and \( h = 8 \) cm. Thus,
