[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m &= \sqrt{ \frac{9}{16} } = \frac{3}{4}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Thus, the speed of the particle is \(\boxed{\frac{3}{4}}\).
