[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m First, we calculate $f(x)$ and $g(x)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ f(x) = \frac{1+x}{1-x}, \quad g(x) = \frac{-2}{x+1}. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m We need to find $g(f(x))$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m f(x) = \frac{1+x}{1-x}, \quad g(f(x)) = g\left(\frac{1+x}{1-x}\right) = \frac{-2}{\frac{1+x}{1-x} + 1} = \frac{-2}{\frac{1+x+1-x}{1-x}} = \frac{-2}{\frac{2}{1-x}} = -(1-x) = x-1.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Next, we find $f(g(x))$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[
