[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[ \text{LCM}(\frac{3}{100}, \frac{1}{45}) \text{ in seconds} = 900 \text{ (seconds)} \div 60 \text{ (per min factor)} = 12 \text{ seconds}. \]
