[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[2b - a = 0 \quad \text{and} \quad c - a = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Thus, $a = c$ and $a = 2b$. By the law of cosines:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \[b^2 = a^2 + c^2 - 2ac \cos B.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Substituting $c = a$ and $a = 2b$:
