[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Comparing this to the quadratic formula, we see that the denominator $2a$ is $8$, which checks out since $2\cdot4=8$. The numerator $-b$ is $-7$, which also checks out. The discriminant $b^2-4ac$ must be $-15$ since the roots have an imaginary part of $\sqrt{-15}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m Let's solve for $k$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1536333)[0m \begin{align*}
